# Update README

When you create a new file, add it to the tree in the root `README.md`.

- The path in the tree must match the real file path.
- Add a short `#` comment saying what the file is. Write that comment in Ukrainian.
- If you create a new folder, add it too, with a short Ukrainian note about its purpose.
- Keep the existing tree format. Do not rewrite descriptions of files this change does not touch.
